  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien spaghetti-western noir in the 1960s Italian western film-score style. A twangy baritone electric guitar with heavy spring reverb and tremolo; a lone trumpet answering the vocal; strummed nylon-string guitar; a galloping snare and floor-tom pattern; timpani hits on the turnarounds; a dry electric bass ostinato. Dry, wide film-score mix with cavernous spring reverb and lots of empty space. A cool, low female alto, half-spoken and clipped in the verses, opening up on the chorus. 124 BPM, A minor. Tense, dry and wry, with a soft landing. No post-punk, no motorik beat, no surf-rock drums, no synths, no pop, no autotune, no rap verse, no trap drums.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n第三法庭 冷氣開甲傷冷\n法官講華語 一句一句慢慢仔講\n阿財伯 穿一領洗甲白去的衫\n伊越頭看我 我是通譯\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊講的 我講\n我講的 伊聽\n\n[Chorus]\n伊講 彼堵壁 食入阮的田\n三十公分 三十公分\n伊講 阮阿公就種到遐\n我共翻做 法官聽有的話\n\n[Verse]\n公司的律師 西裝烏甲金\n圖攤佇桌頂 線畫甲足直\n阿財伯拍桌 喝一句足歹聽的\n彼句 我吞落去\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n法官看我\n我看我的筆記\n\n[Chorus]\n伊講 彼堵壁 食入阮的田\n三十公分 三十公分\n伊講 伊的跤步 就是尺\n我翻 伊對彼塊地 上熟\n\n[Verse]\n法官講 擇日 閣再量一擺\n阿財伯 毋知這是贏抑是輸\n我共伊講 地政的人 會去田頭量\n伊點頭 手猶咧顫\n\n[Bridge]\n伊講 少年的\n我罵的彼句\n你哪攏無翻\n\n[Chorus]\n伊講 彼堵壁 食入阮的田\n三十公分 三十公分\n測量彼工 伊欲徛佇界石邊\n我嘛會去 這擺免翻\n\n[Outro]\n三十公分",
